        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being deployed into enemy territory, your unit is ambushed and you become a prisoner of war. Until you break out of prison, carving a path of destruction on your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/aea4f03e556a418c9b24f00629e5e44a.poster.avif?t=1765841677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/aea4f03e556a418c9b24f00629e5e44a.webm?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/aea4f03e556a418c9b24f00629e5e44a.mp4?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/59f0faa225a8257d18890d41527f2e2f.avif?t=1765841677\" width=780 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against endless hordes of enemies and go for a high score in the wave-based Infinite Mode! Choose from one of 22 maps, customize your experience with more than 50 gameplay modifiers, or play one of the 16 challenges. Unlock hundreds of cosmetics and achievements for reaching score and wave milestones.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/2df24127eb9c2343a82368bc7da5dc81.poster.avif?t=1765841677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/2df24127eb9c2343a82368bc7da5dc81.webm?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/2df24127eb9c2343a82368bc7da5dc81.mp4?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/0c9c21517689886accf93c14c0752420.avif?t=1765841677\" width=780 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the level-based Story Mode and follow the Clippy Commando's adventure as you save the Clipenberg Empire from the threat of the Rulerian Alliance! Each level has a variety of unique optional objectives that offer anything from unique dialogue between the Clippy Commando and fellow war criminal Quartermaster Unicorn to unlocking one of the hundreds of cosmetics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/f6db4692693deb7041ee61a1bf821596.poster.avif?t=1765841677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/f6db4692693deb7041ee61a1bf821596.webm?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/f6db4692693deb7041ee61a1bf821596.mp4?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/93d20a63589072bbc32bc73f3b5b8eff.avif?t=1765841677\" width=780 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Infinite Mode challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Infinite Mode maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >89 Customizable  gameplay modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >121 Story Mode levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >343 Cosmetics, all earned through gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.poster.avif?t=1765841677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.webm?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.mp4?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
