atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/93d20a63589072bbc32bc73f3b5b8eff.avif?t=1765841677\" width=780 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Infinite Mode challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Infinite Mode maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 Weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >89 Customizable  gameplay modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >121 Story Mode levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >343 Cosmetics, all earned through gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.poster.avif?t=1765841677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.webm?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/b721f42ccf80a25e35a4b7e8fa93e7d2.mp4?t=1765841677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
